OpenQuest, by Michael Sheail (2007). Wintermute Engine port by Jenni
McMurray (https://jennibee.itch.io/openquest-wintermute).

This work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International Licence. To view a copy of this licence, visit
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The copy in this directory is modified: the Wintermute runtime binaries are
not included, and the music tracks are replaced by silence (see README.md).
Everything else is the original work, unchanged.
